{"title":"Career Roadmap · Security Analyst","role":"Security Analyst","summary":"A Security Analyst in the defence and strategic-studies context analyses security threats, geopolitical developments, conflicts, terrorism, cyber risks, military capabilities, critical infrastructure and emerging security challenges to support informed decision-making.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts - General / Honours)","Course":"Defence & Strategic Studies"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The career can span strategic research, geopolitical intelligence, corporate security, risk analysis, defence research, policy analysis and security operations."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Defence & Strategic Studies","Security/Research Internship","Security Research Analyst","Security Analyst","Senior Security Analyst","Security/Risk Manager","Strategic Security Lead"]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"“Security Analyst” can mean very different roles. This roadmap focuses primarily on national security, geopolitical, strategic and risk analysis, rather than cybersecurity SOC/security-engineering roles. Cybersecurity requires a substantially different technical pathway."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2027"},{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"Defence, geopolitics, international relations"}],[{"text":"2027–2028"},{"text":"Skill Building"},{"text":"Intelligence analysis + research"}],[{"text":"2028–2029"},{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Security research + analytical tools"}],[{"text":"2029–2031"},{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Research/Security Analyst"}],[{"text":"2031–2034"},{"text":"Development"},{"text":"Senior Security Analyst"}],[{"text":"2034–2038"},{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Strategic/Risk/Geopolitical Analyst"}],[{"text":"20